1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,420
If your baby could talk,
如果宝宝会说话，

2
00:00:01,421 --> 00:00:04,061
they would definitely tell you the back seat is way too hot.
肯定会告诉你：后排真的太热了。

3
00:00:04,062 --> 00:00:06,321
This fan rotates 360 degrees,
这个风扇可以360度旋转，

4
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,380
but the coolest part is the heavy duty clip
更方便的是这个结实的夹子，

5
00:00:08,381 --> 00:00:10,141
that lets you attach it almost anywhere.
几乎到哪儿都能夹着用。

6
00:00:10,142 --> 00:00:13,321
The clip is super durable so you can use it on a camping chair,
夹子很耐用，可以装在露营椅、

7
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:15,700
stroller, crib or just about anything.
婴儿车、婴儿床或者其他地方。

8
00:00:15,701 --> 00:00:17,821
The best part is that it doesn't have any cables
最好的是不用拖着电线，

9
00:00:17,822 --> 00:00:20,261
so you can just recharge it and take it anywhere you need to go.
充好电，就能带去需要的地方。

10
00:00:20,262 --> 00:00:21,221
It uses a quiet
它用的是安静的

11
00:00:21,222 --> 00:00:24,441
turbo motor that's powerful enough to cool down a hot car,
涡轮电机，风力足到能缓解车里的闷热，

12
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,540
but it's so quiet
同时又很安静，

13
00:00:25,541 --> 00:00:27,941
that it shouldn't wake up a sleeping baby in the back seat.
不至于吵醒后排熟睡的宝宝。

14
00:00:27,942 --> 00:00:29,581
This fan has been going super viral.
这款风扇最近特别火。

15
00:00:29,582 --> 00:00:32,061
If you don't want your kid crying every time they sit in the back,
不想让孩子每次一坐后排就热得哭，

16
00:00:32,062 --> 00:00:34,171
you better check if it's still in the orange cart below.
就看看下面的橙色购物车里还有没有。
